<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8000 per</p>
<p>dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after</p>
<p>75.7849 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 28		 July 25</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.6701		 75.6000</p>
<p> Open			     75.7999		 75.8000</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.7849</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     2.555		   1.710</p>
